1. [1mThe specs repository[22m — the directory you are in. It carries this play's folder ([38;2;177;185;249mplays/004-default-view[38;2;255;255;255m: the intent, the plan, the session transcripts and the history) and any[11;3Hdocumentation written for[3Cis play. Stage and commit all of it.[113X[12;3H2. [1mEach target code repository[22m, in its worktree at [38;2;177;185;249mC:\Users\Hugo\.building\data\projects\001-metro\worktrees\004/<repo-folder-name>[38;2;255;255;255m, checked out on branch [38;2;177;185;249m004-default-view[38;2;255;255;255m.[39m[13;3H[172X[38;2;255;255;255m
